## A coarse eight-sided prism with radial vertex normals, every quad wound so its face normal points into the prism,
## under one distant light along the camera axis (tests/zbuffervertexnormals_test.cpp). Not third-party.
Display "zbuffervertexnormals_reversed.tif" "file" "rgba"
Format 64 64 1
Projection "orthographic"
ScreenWindow -1 1 -1 1
Clipping 0.5 50
Translate 0 0 5
WorldBegin
LightSource "distantlight" 1 "intensity" [1] "from" [0 0 -1] "to" [0 0 0]
Surface "matte" "Ka" [0] "Kd" [1]
PointsPolygons [4 4 4 4 4 4 4 4]
